# Plan archive

When a plan is agreed, or when an agreed plan is revised, save a copy in `docs/plans/`.

- Filename: `YYYY-MM-DD-short-slug.md`, using the date the copy is written.
- Body: the plan as agreed, plus one line under the title noting that it is an archived snapshot and the date.
- Leave Cursor plan frontmatter (todos, `isProject`) out of the archive copy.
- A revision on a later day gets a new dated file. Do not overwrite an older snapshot.
- Do this for every plan in this project, not only the WGS workflow.

Example: `docs/plans/2026-10-20-wgs-pipeline-workflow.md`
